      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 732.29,
        "r": 545.1000000000004,
        "b": 708.7
      },
      "content": "If the flat cable (callout 1) is not in the opening (callout 2) in the control panel base, carefully reach in and thread the flat cable through the opening."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0845",
      "reading_order": 1091,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 458.42,
        "r": 480.67000000000024,
        "b": 446.83
      },
      "content": "Position the keyboard flat cable in the connector, and then close the connector latch."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0846",
      "reading_order": 1092,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 434.92,
        "r": 512.5100000000001,
        "b": 423.33
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Slightly tug on the cable to make sure that it is fully captured in the connector ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0847",
      "reading_order": 1093,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 413.92,
        "r": 541.8900000000001,
        "b": 390.33
      },
      "content": "NOTE: When the connector latch is closed and the cable is correctly installed, the white line on the cable is parallel to the connector latch."
    },
